          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umukuru ni yakora icaha, akagira ico akora mu vyo jewe Uhoraho Imana yiwe nabuzanije vyose, atabigize ibigirankana, akikwegera gutsindwa n’urubanza; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "icaha yakoze amaze kukimenyeshwa, az’ azane isuguru y’impene itagira agasembga kw ikimazi ciwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arambike ikiganza mu ruhanga rwayo, ayikererere imbere yanje aho bahora bakererera ikimazi co kwosa: kizoba ar’ ikimazi gitangiwe ivyaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuherezi aheze yābirize urutoke ku maraso y’ico kimazi gitangiwe ivyaha, ayasīge ku mahembe y’igicaniro co kwoserezakw ibimazi, ayandi maraso yaco ayavyagize hasi hambavu y’ico gicaniro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
