              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibinure vyaco vyose avyosereze ku gicaniro, nk’uko bōsa ibinure vy’ikimazi c’ishimwe. Nuk’ umuherezi azoba amuhongeye kur’ ico caha ciwe, na we azoharirwa.",
