          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibinure vyaco vyose az’ abikūre, nk’uko bakūra ivy’ umwana w’intama w’ikimazi c’ ishimwe; uwo muherezi aheze avyosereze ku gicaniro, abigeretse ku bimazi nshikaniwe jewe Uhoraho, bigatōngōrwa n’umuriro. Nuk’ umuherezi azoba amuhongeye kur’ ico caha ciwe yakoze, na we azoharirwa.",
          "type": "text",
